### Why Enrich in the Worker, Not the API?

Parsing a user-agent string and querying a GeoIP database takes ~2–5 milliseconds of CPU time. If you do this in the main request loop, you cut maximum API throughput in half. By pushing enrichment into the asynchronous worker, redirect latency remains untouched at < 5ms.

